  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tokelau Harmonized Aid Program 2021 - 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Tokelau Harmonized Aid Program 2021-2025 delivers Australia&apos;s aid program to Tokelau through a Delegated Cooperation Agreement (DCA) with New Zealand.

The focus areas of the DCA include health, gender, economic development, and climate change adaptation. Tokelau will drive the year-on-year priorities, ensuring the program continues to be responsive to the needs of Tokelau.</narrative>
  </description>
